WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.835 --> 00:00:23.743
Poppy looked at the noisy building.

2
00:00:23.744 --> 00:00:27.178
"I'm not going in," she said.

3
00:00:27.179 --> 00:00:34.306
"The car wash is scary!"

4
00:00:34.307 --> 00:00:42.550
"It's not scary," said Mr. Grill.

5
00:00:42.551 --> 00:00:48.290
"It makes strange sounds," said Poppy.

6
00:00:48.291 --> 00:00:51.256
"Ha-ha!" said Zippy.

7
00:00:51.257 --> 00:00:55.095
"Poppy is afraid!"

8
00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:58.656
Poppy frowned.

9
00:00:58.657 --> 00:01:02.510
"The car wash is fun," said Jeb.

10
00:01:02.511 --> 00:01:06.592
"It has big brushes."

11
00:01:06.593 --> 00:01:14.625
"Brushes aren't fun," said Poppy.

12
00:01:14.626 --> 00:01:18.568
"It sprays you with water," said Dipper.

13
00:01:18.569 --> 00:01:21.716
"Hmm," said Poppy.

14
00:01:21.717 --> 00:01:36.086
"Water is kind of fun."

15
00:01:36.087 --> 00:01:39.555
"There are bubbles," said Eddy.

16
00:01:39.556 --> 00:01:42.350
Poppy's eyes got wide.

17
00:01:42.351 --> 00:01:46.866
"Bubbles?" she said.

18
00:01:46.867 --> 00:01:49.564
"I love bubbles!"

19
00:01:49.565 --> 00:01:52.678
Honk! Honk!

20
00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:56.462
Poppy raced into the car wash.

21
00:01:56.463 --> 00:01:59.747
"Woo-hoo!" she cried.

22
00:01:59.748 --> 00:02:09.838
"This is fun!"

23
00:02:09.839 --> 00:02:19.666
Everyone went back to school.

24
00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:23.609
"I love the car wash!" said Poppy.

25
00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:30.079
"That was the best field trip!"
